{"id":"c5b1e64ccdf8eae8","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-closed-term.md","title":"Closed Term","display":"df-closed-term — Closed Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-closed-term","aliases":["88-df-closed-term"],"display":"df-closed-term — Closed Term","depends_on":["[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-closed-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-closed-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-term — Closed Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> (candidate term, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}_S(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{var}_S(t)\\)</span> (term-variable set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)\\)</span> (closed-term predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}term} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)\n\\leftrightarrow\nt\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\land\\mathrm{var}_S(t)=\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}term} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)\n\\leftrightarrow\nt\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\land\\mathrm{var}_S(t)=\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S\\)</span> : 闭项谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}_S(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{var}_S(t)\\)</span> : 项<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>中的变量集 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>闭项的形成规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个常量符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是闭项</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1, \\ldots, t_n\">\\(t_1, \\ldots, t_n\\)</span> 都是闭项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元函数符号，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(t_1, \\ldots, t_n)\">\\(f(t_1, \\ldots, t_n)\\)</span> 是闭项</li>\n</ol>\n<p>闭项在语义上有确定的指称：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>闭项在任意结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span> 中指称唯一元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^{\\mathcal{M}}\">\\(t^{\\mathcal{M}}\\)</span></li>\n<li>闭项不需要变量赋值就能确定指称对象</li>\n<li>闭项相当于&quot;常数&quot;或&quot;具体名称&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>例子（Peano算术）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> —— 基本闭项</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(0)\">\\(S(0)\\)</span> —— 后继闭项，指称1</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+(S(0), S(S(0)))\">\\(+(S(0), S(S(0)))\\)</span> —— 指称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1 + 2 = 3\">\\(1 + 2 = 3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>：闭项是项的子类</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a>：数字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n}\">\\(\\overline{n}\\)</span> 是特殊闭项</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>：闭项不含自由变量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t$ (candidate term, see [[./88-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{var}_S(t)$ (term-variable set, see [[88-df-free-variable]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{var}_S(t)$ : 项$t$中的变量集 (see [[88-df-free-variable]])","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]：闭项是项的子类","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]：数字 $\\overline{n}$ 是特殊闭项","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]：闭项不含自由变量","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{var}_S(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}term} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S(t)\n\\leftrightarrow\nt\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\land\\mathrm{var}_S(t)=\\emptyset","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{var}_S(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"t_1, \\ldots, t_n","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"f(t_1, \\ldots, t_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}","display":false},{"tex":"t^{\\mathcal{M}}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S(0)","display":false},{"tex":"+(S(0), S(S(0)))","display":false},{"tex":"1 + 2 = 3","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{n}","display":false}],"bytes":1485,"backlinks":[{"id":"19f597e8b5469bbc","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CTerm}_S$ (set of closed terms, see [[88-df-closed-term]])"},{"id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","ancho